<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal leaves drain rate unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal leaves drain rate unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal left its draining rate unchanged at 6.8 percent at the start of a new commercial bank reserve period on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts had widely expected the Bank to cut the rate at which it is ready to absorb excess market funds by up to 30 basis points from the start of the new period on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
